  "notes": "Extracted from the primary paper (snippet: nutrient medium was modified Shewanella basal medium (SBM), consisting of the following components (per litre): K2HPO4, 0.225 g; KH2PO4, 0.225 g; NaCl, 0.46 g; (NH4)2SO4, 0.225 g; MgSO4·7H2O, 0.117 g;). Component names mapped to BiGG (see mapping_confidence); presence-based bounds unless the paper gave exchange bounds; concentration_mM where units allowed. Extraction confidence: high.",
  "verification": "paper-verified (corrected via workflow)",
  "verification_evidence": "The nutrient medium was modified Shewanella basal medium (SBM), consisting of the following components (per litre): K2HPO4, 0.225 g; KH2PO4, 0.225 g; NaCl, 0.46 g; (NH4)2SO4, 0.225 g; MgSO4·7 H2O, 0.117 g; HEPES, 23.83 g. Sodium lactate (20 mM) was provided as the carbon source. Mineral and vitamin mix (5 ml each) was added. The mineral mix consisted of nitrilotriacetic acid, 1.5 g; MnCl·4 H2O, 0.",
  "verification_confidence": "high",
